at Cristine and the library were merely illusions, Sophie cast [[Breakspell]] on Cristine, causing her to vanish. {{source|The Beautiful Trap}}\n\n[[it:Isola di Madea]]\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Minor characters]]\n[[Category:Non-Seekers]]\n[[Category:Magical traps]]","categories":["Characters","Magical traps","Minor characters","Non-Seekers"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:5196","status":"resolved","target_title":"Madea Island","label":"Madea Island","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Madea_Island","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5196"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8758","status":"resolved","target_title":"Madea Island Casterwill Library","label":"Madea Island Casterwill Library","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Madea_Island_Casterwill_Library","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8758"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3371","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Beautiful Trap","label":"The Beautiful Trap","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Beautiful_Trap","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3371"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3371","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Beautiful Trap","label":"The Beautiful Trap","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Beautiful_Trap","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3371"},{"target_title":"Erica Schroeder","label":"Erica Schroeder","target_id":null,"target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Erica_Schroeder","status":"unresolved"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:5196","status":"resolved","target_title":"Madea Island","label":"Madea Island","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Madea_Island","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5196"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2010","status":"resolved","target_title":"Titan","label":"Titan","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Titan","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2010"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3147","status":"resolved","target_title":"Madea","label":"Madea","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Madea","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3147"},